flowchart TD
    OAuth["OAuth Callback<br/>1조: 현제 / 민성 / 우진"] --> FindOrCreate["user = userRepo.findOrCreate(profile)"]
    FindOrCreate --> Ensure["adminBootstrap.ensureAdminRoleIfEligible(user)"]
    Ensure --> Check{"user.id ∈<br/>INITIAL_ADMIN_USER_IDS env?"}

    Check -- no --> ReturnAsIs["user 그대로 반환"]
    Check -- yes --> AlreadyAdmin{"user.role<br/>=== 'admin'?"}

    AlreadyAdmin -- yes --> ReturnAsIs
    AlreadyAdmin -- no --> Update["userRepo.updateRole(user.id, ADMIN)<br/>← DB UPDATE (1회, idempotent)"]
    Update --> Log["logger.log<br/>'Initial admin promoted'"]
    Log --> ReturnAdmin["role=admin user 반환"]

    ReturnAsIs --> JWT["JwtService.sign(payload)<br/>← 숙희: scope = role==='admin' ? ['admin'] : []"]
    ReturnAdmin --> JWT
    JWT --> Response["클라이언트에 access/refresh 토큰 응답"]

    Note1["env 변경 즉시 반영 X<br/>(다음 로그인 시 매칭)"]
    Note2["강등은 자동으로 일어나지 않음<br/>(추가만 반영)"]
    Note1 -.-> Check
    Note2 -.-> AlreadyAdmin

    classDef extn fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#856404,color:#856404
    classDef db fill:#d1ecf1,stroke:#0c5460,color:#0c5460
    classDef note fill:#f8f9fa,stroke:#6c757d,color:#6c757d,font-size:11px
    class OAuth,JWT extn
    class Update db
    class Note1,Note2 note
